WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Fundraiser Studio: helping an organizer choose the next step,
tell a personal story, and prepare an invitation.

00:10.000 --> 00:24.000
The dashboard suggests a next step. Its explanation
and timing controls let the organizer review the suggestion.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
The suggested action opens the campaign editor,
where the organizer can prepare and save the campaign.

00:34.000 --> 00:44.000
The earlier prototype opens a saved campaign preview
with the matching title and story. Figures are sample data.

00:44.000 --> 00:54.000
The flyer builder carries the campaign details forward
and offers a QR code.

00:54.000 --> 01:04.000
The export dialog offers file formats.
This sequence shows prototype checks, not participant research.
